  - m_Id: 887346724864
    m_Localized: "Crafted with love, mud, and whatever was lying around, this grand
      square stadium is held together by sheer determination and Rammy's engineering
      skills. \nThe crowd? Questionable. \nThe vibes? Immaculate."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1030267633664
    m_Localized: "Long abandoned by time and squirrels, these ancient stone ruins
      once echoed with mysterious chants and magical burps. Now it\u2019s just a
      great place to duel and accidentally summon something."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
